## JOB SEARCH CRITERIA (STRICT FILTERS)

### Role Criteria (Title Match - ANY of these):
- "Assistant Editor"
- "Junior Editor"
- "Editor" (when combined with other criteria)
- Related: "Post-Production Editor", "Video Editor", "Media Manager"

### Location Criteria (ANY of these):
- **NYC-specific:** "New York", "NYC", "New York City", "Manhattan", "Brooklyn", "Queens"
- **Jersey-specific:** "Jersey City", "New Jersey", "NJ"
- **Remote:** "Remote", "Work from home", "Telecommute", "Distributed team"
- **REJECT:** Any role requiring relocation outside NYC/Jersey City unless explicitly "Remote"

### Software Criteria (OPTIONAL - relaxed filter):
- Ideally mention: "Avid" OR "Premiere Pro" OR "Adobe Premiere"
- If not mentioned in job description, still accept role IF location + title match (lower priority flag)
- BONUS: Mention of DaVinci Resolve, After Effects, Avid Media Composer

### Content Type Priorities:
- Unscripted TV/Film (Documentaries, Reality, Competition shows)
- Scripted Content (Drama, Comedy series)
- High-quality digital content
- Music videos, commercials
- Educational content
- AVOID: Low-quality content mills, MLM schemes, pure social media posting

