## DAILY SWEEP EXECUTION FLOW

### Schedule:
- **Time:** 9:00 AM daily (configured in cron for automated runs)
- **Manual override:** Agent can be triggered on-demand via n8n interface
- **Retry logic:** Failed source attempts should retry after 30 seconds, max 3 attempts

### Per-Source Scraping:
```
For each job source:
  1. Initiate connection (HTTP GET / Selenium browser)
  2. Pass search parameters:
     - Keywords: "assistant editor", "junior editor", "editor"
     - Location: "New York", "NYC", "Jersey City", "Remote"
     - Date filter: Last 7 days (if available)
  3. Parse response: Extract job data
  4. Map to standard schema: [title, company, location, url, date_posted, description]
  5. On error: Log error, continue to next source
  6. Collect all jobs in single array
```

### Data Collection Fields (Per Job):
- **title** (string) - Job title as posted
- **company** (string) - Hiring company name
- **location** (string) - Location as stated in listing
- **url** (string, CRITICAL) - Direct link to job posting (clickable, full URL)
- **date_posted** (string) - Posted date if available (format: "X days ago" or "YYYY-MM-DD")
- **description** (text) - Job description snippet (first 500 chars)
- **source** (string) - Job board name (Indeed, Glassdoor, etc.)

