## EXECUTION WORKFLOW (N8N NODES)

### Node 1: Trigger
- Type: Cron / Schedule
- Time: Daily at 09:00 AM
- Alternative: Manual webhook trigger for testing

### Node 2-14: Parallel Job Scrapers (One per source)
- Each node runs concurrently (n8n parallel execution)
- Try-catch error handling, returns empty array on failure
- Timeout: 30 seconds per source (safety limit)

### Node 15: Merge Results
- Combine all job arrays from sources 2-14
- Deduplicate by URL and title+company combo
- Output: Single array of ~50-100 jobs

### Node 16: Filter Jobs
- Apply role, location, software filters
- Output: ~10-20 filtered jobs

### Node 17-19: Enrich (Claude/AI step)
- For each job:
  - Generate short message (Claude call 1)
  - Generate cover letter (Claude call 2, includes resume context)
- Output: Jobs with enriched fields

### Node 20: Write to Excel
- Open existing `Jobs_Agent_AI.xlsx`
- Add separator row with sweep date
- Append enriched job rows
- Save file
- Log: "Logged X jobs on DD/MM/YYYY"

### Node 21: Notify (Optional)
- Send summary to Slack or email: "Sweep complete: X new jobs found"

